<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 11.5 trln rbls in T-bills Aug 13.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 11.5 trln rbls in T-bills Aug 13.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Finance Ministry will auction 4.50 trillion roubles ($775.3 million) in 182-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 21084) and seven trillion roubles in 364-day T-bills (series 21085) on August 13, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
